  "description": "Hip-to-gable roof conversion with rear facing dormer to main roof, and small rear dormer with hip-to-gable conversion to lower side roof and front rooflight. \r\r\r",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed roof alterations and dormers, by reason of the size, scale, bulk, proportion, location, design, roof form and massing, would result in a dominant and cluttered additions to the existing roof plane and significantly disrupt the balance of the semi-detached pair. The development would therefore erode the character and composition of the host dwelling, host pair and surrounding area, contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), Policies DMD 8, DMD 13 and DMD 37 of the Development Management Document (2014), and the National Planning Policy Framework (2024)."
